message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Veridalis: biodiversity data harmonization, quality checking and screening"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Samadder
    given-names: Ananya
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3774-9456"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ananyastack/eco-audit-ai"
url: "https://eco-audit-ai-avci9d7appmnzeehkhfppwf.streamlit.app"
abstract: >-
  Open-source web app that maps biodiversity survey and occurrence tables to
  standard column names, runs basic automated quality checks, and screens the
  data with richness, Shannon, Simpson, Pielou and Margalef indices, with an
  interactive map and downloadable tables. Exploratory research software; not
  a validated tool.
keywords:
  - biodiversity
  - GBIF
  - Darwin Core
  - data quality
  - ecology
